          <i class="fas fa-lock" style="color:#2a6f97;"></i> Task 1: Serial vs Parallel
          <span class="stars"><span class="star-filled">★</span><span class="star-empty">★</span><span class="star-empty">★</span></span> Mild
        </h3>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span class="task-timer" id="timer1" onclick="startTimer(1, 300)"><i class="fas fa-play"></i> Start Timer (5 min)</span>
