            <p>These terms can be combined with serial and parallel:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>A <strong>serial, simplex</strong> cable sends one bit at a time in one direction only.</li>
              <li>A <strong>parallel, full-duplex</strong> cable sends multiple bits at a time in both directions simultaneously.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

